# Telegram deep links for the Hero Card share and «دعوت هم‌رزم» (see README → Challenge and
# invite links). These are public values, baked into the build.
#
# Leave both empty (or remove the file) for a build without bot settings: links then point at the
# page itself with ?startapp=…, which works in a normal browser and for local testing.
#
# VITE_TG_BOT: the bot's username — `YourBot`, `@YourBot` or `https://t.me/YourBot` all work.
# VITE_TG_APP: the Mini App's short name from BotFather. Optional; without it links open the bot's
#              Main Mini App. A full `https://t.me/YourBot/YourApp` in either variable sets both.
VITE_TG_BOT=
VITE_TG_APP=
